### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Confirm email - wklej token z odpowiedzi register
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/confirm?token=TOKEN

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Fetch demo events
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/events/fetch

### Normalize demo events
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/events/normalize

### List events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events

### Add favorite
POST http://localhost:8080/api/favorites/EVENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Send notification
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notifications/events/EVENT_ID?channel=EMAIL
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
